<mxCell id="note0" value="MULTIPLICITY: 1 = exactly one; 0..1 = optional; 0..* = zero or more. No arrowhead is required on a bidirectional association.&#10;Customer represents both students and parents; ParentId links Customer to Customer. Notification.RecipientId points to User, not Customer.&#10;For attendance notifications, AttendanceAuditLogId is present and unique; generic notifications can have no attendance audit. Each audit produces at most one notification.&#10;Unique attendance key: (CustomerId, TimetableEntryId, AttendanceDate). Status: PRESENT / ABSENT / LATE / EXCUSED. No AttendanceSession or Submitted state.&#10;Subject, Semester, Room, AcademicYear, GradeLevel and role classes are reused context and omitted here. Additional reviewer/requester/sender associations are omitted for clarity." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=15;fontSize=18;fillColor=#F5F8FC;strokeColor=#B8C7D6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2250" width="3590" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
