<mxCell id="note0" value="LEGEND: dashed open arrow = dependency; dashed hollow triangle = interface implementation; solid hollow triangle = class inheritance.&#10;IAttendanceRepository also extends IGenericRepository&lt;AttendanceRecord&gt; (contract omitted). AttendanceRepository reuses GenericRepository; no separate session repository.&#10;NotificationDispatcher inherits BackgroundService; NotificationHub inherits Hub. IHubContext.Clients.User(...).SendAsync(...) targets the authenticated parent UserId.&#10;DTOs SaveAttendanceDto / AttendanceInput carry RosterToken and Version; entities and their relationships are shown in the domain class diagram." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=15;fontSize=18;fillColor=#F5F8FC;strokeColor=#B8C7D6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="2225" width="3150" height="145" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
