<mxCell id="rules" value="READABILITY: intermediate returns, helper calls and per-student loops are omitted; grouped reads reuse AttendanceRepository.GetLeavesAsync().&#10;VALIDATION: PRESENT / ABSENT / LATE / EXCUSED; EXCUSED requires approved leave. Corrections require a reason; stale data requires reload.&#10;TIME: no marking before lesson start. Teacher locks at 00:00 next day (Vietnam time); STAFF / ADMIN are exempt from that deadline.&#10;ATOMIC SAVE: results + audit + applicable notifications commit together. Unchanged save: no new audit / notification. Delivery runs in the background after commit." style="shape=note;html=0;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;spacing=14;fontSize=17;fillColor=#FFF8DF;strokeColor=#C7AD61;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="1740" width="2130" height="135" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="legend" value="Solid arrows = calls/actions. Dashed arrows = returns. Vertical dashed lines = lifelines. The alt frame summarizes success / failure outcomes." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=17;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="1894" width="2130" height="43" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram>
